"description": "The canvas hero that works on a white page. A grid of dots whose size follows a travelling wave -- organic noise, a ripple spreading from a focus point, or a diagonal sweep -- like print halftone brought to life; wave peaks tint to the accent colour, and the pointer swells the dots around it. Ink on paper by default, so it sits inside a light document; flip ink and paper for a dark version. Optional eyebrow/title/body copy behind a veil. Honours prefers-reduced-motion (one static frame), pauses offscreen, DPR-aware. Same kit and hardening as flow_field: every option is an enum or a clamped int; colours must be #rrggbb.",
